@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Step-by-step publication algorithm
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Validate intended actor/resource/version/confirmation/identity;
:Establish chosen bounded guard;
if (Current authority and lifecycle eligible?) then (yes)
 if (Identity matches this intent?) then (yes)
  if (Recorded outcome exists?) then (yes)
   :Project recorded result under current disclosure policy;
  else (no)
   if (Expected draft version matches?) then (yes)
    :Validate exact snapshot;
    :Commit revision + live pointer + command result;
    :Return observed outcome or reconcile same identity;
   else (no)
    :Conflict without new publication;
   endif
  endif
 else (no)
  :Identity conflict without new publication;
 endif
else (no)
 :Safe denial without private disclosure;
endif
:Release bounded resources on all exits;
stop

@enduml
